    <div class="doc-title">TRIPARTITE AGREEMENT</div>

    <p class="center"><b>This agreement is executed on this _____ day of ______________</b></p>

    <div class="section-label">By and Between</div>

    <p><b>MR. RUDRARAJU BHARATH</b>, S/o. MR. RUDRARAJU RAMANA RAJU, aged about 33 years,
    Occupation: IT-Employee; R/o: Flat No: 1503, Block -E, Aditya Empress Towers, Shaikpet,
